                 organization translated into another language is not confusably similar to the original
                 within \S\,86a(2) sentence~2, and the name of an organization under \S\,86(1) Nr.~2 and~4
                 is not as such an insignium within \S\,86a(2) sentence~1. The name is covered where it has
                 been given a particular form, “in signifikanten Schriftzügen dargestellt.” The
                 association Blood \& Honour Division Deutschland was banned by order of the Federal
                 Minister of the Interior of 12 September 2000 and that ban became final on 13 June 2001.
